    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44291" root="&#xA;                        هزل&#xA;                    " body-key="h1">
                        
                            1
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَزْلٌ</span></b> 
                         is <i>contr. of</i>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جِدٌّ</span>. (S, Mgh, K.) You
say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَزَلَ</span>, aor. 
    
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَزِلَ</span></b> 
                        , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَزْلٌ</span>; (S, Msb, K;)
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَزِلَ</span>, aor. 
    
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَزَلَ</span></b> 
                        , (K,) inf. n. as above; (TA;)
and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَازَلَ</span></b> ; (K;) <i>He jested,</i> or <i>joked;</i> (Msb;)
or <i>was not serious,</i> or <i>in earnest;</i> (TA;) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِى كَلاَمِهِ</span>
                        <i>in his speech;</i> (Msb, TA;) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِى الأَمْرِ</span>
                        <i>in the
affair.</i> (TA.)

